# What `docker build .` leaves out of the context (apps/relay/Dockerfile). Mirrors .gitignore's build
# output and local state, so the context is the tracked source.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
.acorn
**/.acorn
.git
apps/node/release
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen
references
test-results
.coverage
**/.env
**/*.log
